Part 1: symbolic conditions
  (1) lL,lR beat R's lines at 1/2: r0 - phi > 0:  -(4*c*n - 2*eps - 1)/4
  (2) lL,lR beat N's lines at 1/2: r0 + phi' > 0:  (-2*eps + n - 1)/(4*(n - 1))
  (3) root invalid: n c - eps > 0:  c*n - eps
  (4) N's own line dominates at 0: -phi' - lL(0) > 0:  3*eps/(8*(n - 1))
  (4') and -phi' - lR(0) > 0:  5*eps/(8*(n - 1))
  (5) wrong cut invalid: -(m_N(0) - (n-1)c + eps) > 0:  (2*c*n**2 - 2*c*n - 2*eps*n + eps)/(2*(n - 1))
  (6) right cut valid: phi - (n-1)c + eps >= 0:  eps/2
  (7) R's line dominates at 0: phi - lL(0) > 0:  (8*c*n**2 - 8*c*n - 4*eps*n + 3*eps)/(8*(n - 1))
  admissible c: eps*(2*n - 1)/(2*n*(n - 1)) < c < (2*eps + 1)/(4*n)  (also c > eps/n from (3))
  hi - lo = -(2*eps*n - n + 1)/(4*n*(n - 1))   (> 0 iff eps < (n-1)/(2n))
  choice c = 1/(5n), eps = 1/100 (so r0 = 1/4 - 1/(5n), = 3/20 at n = 2):
    (1) lL,lR beat R's lines at 1/2: r0 - phi > 0: 11/200  -> positive for all n >= 2
    (2) lL,lR beat N's lines at 1/2: r0 + phi' > 0: (50*n - 51)/(200*(n - 1))  -> positive for all n >= 2
    (3) root invalid: n c - eps > 0: 19/100  -> positive for all n >= 2
    (4) N's own line dominates at 0: -phi' - lL(0) > 0: 3/(800*(n - 1))  -> positive for all n >= 2
    (4') and -phi' - lR(0) > 0: 1/(160*(n - 1))  -> positive for all n >= 2
    (5) wrong cut invalid: -(m_N(0) - (n-1)c + eps) > 0: (38*n - 39)/(200*(n - 1))  -> positive for all n >= 2
    (6) right cut valid: phi - (n-1)c + eps >= 0: 1/200  -> = 1/200 (>= 0)
    (7) R's line dominates at 0: phi - lL(0) > 0: (156*n - 157)/(800*(n - 1))  -> positive for all n >= 2

